ly winds, strong offshore, up to gale force on high ground. Temperatures will fall further to a minimum of about 19 degrees tonight.","outlook":"Still windy and appreciably cooler with a minimum temperature of around 16 degrees tomorrow morning. It will still be cool in the New Territories on Wednesday morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. Temperatures will rise in the latter part of this week.","updateTime":"2026-11-09T12:45:00+08:00"},"dailyForecast":{"generalSituation":"The northeast monsoon will bring generally fine and very dry weather to Guangdong in the next couple of days. It will be cool in the morning over the region with rather large temperature difference between day and night. With the monsoon moderating in the latter part of this week, temperatures will rise over the region. Under the influence of upper-air disturbances, it will be cloudier with a few showers over southern China over the weekend. The weather will be relatively humid over the coastal areas early next week. Another surge of the northeast monsoon will affect the coast of Guangdong midweek next week. Besides, Tropical Cyclone Cempaka will move across the seas south of Japan in the next couple of days, then evolve into an extratropical cyclone gradually.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20261110","week":"Tuesday","forecastWind":"North to northeast force 4 to 5, occasionally force 6 offshore at first, up to force 8 on high ground.","forecastWeather":"Cool in the morning. Fine. Very dry during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":23,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":16,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":60,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":35,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":92,"PSR":"Low"},{"forecastDate":"20261111","week":"Wednesday","forecastWind":"Northeast force 4.","forecastWeather":"Fine and dry. Slightly cooler in the morning.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":25,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":18,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxr